        <div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">Can you take over an existing Magento or Adobe Commerce site?<span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></button><div class="faq-answer">We regularly onboard Magento, Adobe Commerce and Hyva stores. We begin with a full technical and performance audit to understand your setup, uncover issues and define the most impactful improvements. Whether you need quick fixes, better performance or a long-term roadmap, we can stabilise and strengthen your site.</div></div>
