        <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">How do you approach a new development project?<span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></button><div class="faq-answer" style="display:none">Every engagement starts with discovery. We learn about your systems, customers and commercial goals, then create detailed plans, wireframes and technical specifications. This ensures development runs smoothly and your final solution is aligned with both technical requirements and user needs.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">Do you provide ongoing support after launch?<span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></button><div class="faq-answer" style="display:none">We offer flexible Magento and Adobe Commerce support packages with clear SLAs. Support includes maintenance, security patching, speed optimisation, Hyva upgrades and ongoing development so your site continues to evolve.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">How can you help my website grow?<span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></button><div class="faq-answer" style="display:none">We provide ongoing optimisation, including conversion rate optimisation (CRO), UX improvements, analytics, SEO, Magento performance optimisation and personalised user experiences. Our goal is to improve speed, clarity and conversion across every interaction.</div></div>
